@* Radzen.Blazor — re-added 2026-09-02 for the Archive data grid and the model-profile
   rating chart. See PoLocalCompare.Client.csproj for the payload it costs. *@
@using Radzen
@using Radzen.Blazor

@* Radzen ships its own ThemeService, which collides with ours (NavMenu injects the app's
   one to drive the light/dark toggle). Alias rather than fully-qualifying at each use site,
   so the ~10 references in NavMenu and Program.cs stay readable. If Radzen's theming is ever
   adopted, this alias is the line to revisit. *@
@using ThemeService = PoLocalCompare.Client.Services.ThemeService

@* Require an authenticated session for every routable page (BFF cookie). *@
@* Non-routed components ignore this; the Login view is rendered via NotAuthorized. *@
@attribute [Authorize]
